1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,480
The dumbest man in America got RICH… from terrible advice!

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,080
1790s. Rival merchants wanted Timothy Dexter broke.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,960
So they told him: ship bed warmers… to the Caribbean!

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:12,930
He did. They used them as molasses ladles. Sold out!

5
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:16,890
Next: wool mittens… to the tropics. Traders bought them all, for Siberia!

6
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:20,770
Then: coal… to a coal town. The miners were on strike. Sold out again!

7
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:23,460
So Dexter wrote a book… with no punctuation at all.

8
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:27,750
Readers complained. So the second edition added a page of just punctuation…

9
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:30,220
so they could salt and pepper it as they please.
